@page "/aac-format"

<PageTitle>AAC Format Reference</PageTitle>

<div class="container-fluid">
    <h1 class="mb-4">
        <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-zip"></i>
        Anna's Archive Container (AAC) Format
    </h1>
    
    <div class="alert alert-info">
        <strong>Source:</strong> Anna's Archive Blog, 2023-08-15 
        <br/>
        <em>Standardizing releases from the world's largest shadow library</em>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
            <!-- Overview -->
            <section class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                    <h5 class="mb-0">Overview</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>
                        Anna's Archive has become the largest shadow library in the world, and the only shadow library 
                        of its scale that is fully open-source and open-data. To manage releases of 100s of TBs of data,
                        they standardized their release format: <strong>Anna's Archive Containers (AAC)</strong>.
                    </p>
                    <table class="table table-sm table-striped">
                        <thead>
                            <tr><th>Source</th><th>Files</th><th>Size</th><th>Mirrored</th></tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr><td>Sci-Hub</td><td>86.6M</td><td>87.2 TB</td><td>99.96%</td></tr>
                            <tr><td>Library Genesis</td><td>16.3M</td><td>208.1 TB</td><td>87%</td></tr>
                            <tr><td>Z-Library</td><td>13.8M</td><td>97.3 TB</td><td>99.91%</td></tr>
                            <tr class="table-primary fw-bold"><td>Total (deduplicated)</td><td>111M</td><td>419.5 TB</td><td>98%</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- AACID Format -->
            <section class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header bg-success text-white">
                    <h5 class="mb-0">AACID Format</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>The <strong>AACID</strong> (Anna's Archive Content ID) is a globally unique identifier for each item:</p>
                    
                    <div class="bg-dark text-light p-3 rounded font-monospace mb-3">
                        aacid__{collection}__{timestamp}__{source_id}__{shortuuid}
                    </div>

                    <table class="table table-bordered">
                        <thead class="table-light">
                            <tr><th>Component</th><th>Description</th><th>Example</th></tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>collection</code></td>
                                <td>Collection name (letters, numbers, underscores)</td>
                                <td><code>zlib3_records</code></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>timestamp</code></td>
                                <td>ISO 8601 UTC timestamp (monotonically increasing)</td>
                                <td><code>20230808T014342Z</code></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>source_id</code></td>
                                <td>Collection-specific ID (optional, may be truncated)</td>
                                <td><code>22433983</code></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><code>shortuuid</code></td>
                                <td>Compressed UUID (base57)</td>
                                <td><code>URsJNGy5CjokTsNT6hUmmj</code></td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>

                    <div class="alert alert-secondary">
                        <strong>Example AACID:</strong><br/>
                        <code class="text-break">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z__22433983__URsJNGy5CjokTsNT6hUmmj</code>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Collections -->
            <section class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header bg-warning">
                    <h5 class="mb-0">Collections</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Each AAC belongs to a <strong>collection</strong> - a list of semantically consistent AACs.</p>
                    
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="card border-info mb-2">
                                <div class="card-header bg-info text-white">Records Collections</div>
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <p class="small">Metadata-only: titles, authors, ISBNs, etc.</p>
                                    <ul class="small mb-0">
                                        <li><code>zlib3_records</code></li>
                                        <li><code>libgenli_records</code></li>
                                        <li><code>gbooks_records</code></li>
                                        <li><code>isbndb_records</code></li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="card border-success mb-2">
                                <div class="card-header bg-success text-white">Files Collections</div>
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <p class="small">Actual binary files: PDF, EPUB, etc.</p>
                                    <ul class="small mb-0">
                                        <li><code>zlib3_files</code></li>
                                        <li><code>libgenli_files</code></li>
                                        <li><code>ia2_acsmpdf_files</code></li>
                                        <li><code>duxiu_files</code></li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- File Formats -->
            <section class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header bg-secondary text-white">
                    <h5 class="mb-0">File Formats</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h6>Metadata Files</h6>
                    <div class="bg-light p-2 rounded font-monospace small mb-3">
                        annas_archive_meta__aacid__{collection}__{from}--{to}.jsonl.zst
                    </div>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Format: <strong>JSON Lines</strong> compressed with <strong>Zstandard</strong></li>
                        <li>Each line: <code>{"aacid": "...", "metadata": {...}, "data_folder": "..."}</code></li>
                        <li><code>data_folder</code> is optional - points to binary data location</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h6 class="mt-4">Binary Data Folders</h6>
                    <div class="bg-light p-2 rounded font-monospace small mb-3">
                        annas_archive_data__aacid__{collection}__{from}--{to}/
                    </div>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Contains actual files (PDF, EPUB, etc.)</li>
                        <li>Each file named by its AACID (no extension)</li>
                        <li>Recommended size: 100GB - 1TB per folder</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h6 class="mt-4">MyDumper Database Exports</h6>
                    <div class="bg-light p-2 rounded font-monospace small mb-3">
                        allthethings.{table_name}.00000.dat.gz
                    </div>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Format: <strong>CSV</strong> compressed with <strong>gzip</strong></li>
                        <li>Multi-part files numbered: <code>.00000</code>, <code>.00001</code>, etc.</li>
                        <li>Schema in: <code>allthethings.{table_name}-schema.sql.gz</code></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Database Tables -->
            <section class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header bg-dark text-white">
                    <h5 class="mb-0">Key Database Tables</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h6>Lookup Tables (code → aarecord_id)</h6>
                    <p class="small text-muted">Map ISBNs, DOIs, and other identifiers to internal record IDs</p>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <ul class="small">
                                <li><code>aarecords_codes_isbndb_for_lookup</code></li>
                                <li><code>aarecords_codes_ol_for_lookup</code></li>
                                <li><code>aarecords_codes_gbooks_for_lookup</code></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <ul class="small">
                                <li><code>aarecords_codes_goodreads_for_lookup</code></li>
                                <li><code>aarecords_codes_oclc_for_lookup</code></li>
                                <li><code>aarecords_codes_libby_for_lookup</code></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">Pointer Tables (aacid → byte_offset)</h6>
                    <p class="small text-muted">Point to metadata location in JSONL files</p>
                    <ul class="small">
                        <li><code>annas_archive_meta__aacid__zlib3_records</code></li>
                        <li><code>annas_archive_meta__aacid__gbooks_records</code></li>
                        <li><code>annas_archive_meta__aacid__isbngrp_records</code></li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="small">Columns: <code>aacid</code>, <code>primary_id</code>, <code>md5</code>, <code>byte_offset</code>, <code>byte_length</code></p>

                    <h6 class="mt-3">libgenli Tables (Library Genesis International)</h6>
                    <ul class="small">
                        <li><code>libgenli_editions</code> - 154M book editions</li>
                        <li><code>libgenli_files</code> - 111M file records</li>
                        <li><code>libgenli_series</code> - 511K series</li>
                        <li><code>libgenli_publishers</code> - 49K publishers</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar -->
        <div class="col-lg-4">
            <div class="card mb-4 position-sticky" style="top: 1rem;">
                <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                    <h6 class="mb-0">Quick Reference</h6>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h6>Design Goals</h6>
                    <ul class="small">
                        <li>Heterogeneous files & metadata</li>
                        <li>Torrent distribution</li>
                        <li>Immutable records</li>
                        <li>Incremental/appendable releases</li>
                        <li>Machine-readable (Python, MySQL)</li>
                    </ul>

                    <hr/>

                    <h6>File Extensions</h6>
                    <table class="table table-sm small">
                        <tr><td><code>.jsonl.zst</code></td><td>Zstd JSON Lines</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>.dat.gz</code></td><td>Gzip CSV data</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>-schema.sql.gz</code></td><td>Table schema</td></tr>
                    </table>

                    <hr/>

                    <h6>Decompression</h6>
                    <pre class="bg-dark text-light p-2 small rounded"><code>zstdcat file.jsonl.zst
gzip -d file.dat.gz</code></pre>

                    <hr/>

                    <h6>Links</h6>
                    <ul class="small list-unstyled">
                        <li><a href="https://annas-archive.li/datasets" target="_blank">Datasets Page</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://annas-archive.li/blog" target="_blank">Blog</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://software.annas-archive.li" target="_blank">Software</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

